<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Orchestration on Chen Kai Blog</title><link>https://www.chenk.top/zh/tags/orchestration/</link><description>Recent content in Orchestration on Chen Kai Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 09:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.chenk.top/zh/tags/orchestration/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>让 Agent 靠谱起来（1）：构建，才是唯一的验收门</title><link>https://www.chenk.top/zh/reliable-agents/01-build-is-the-gate/</link><pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.chenk.top/zh/reliable-agents/01-build-is-the-gate/</guid><description>&lt;p>上个月一次三 agent 的任务，最后留给我一个编译不过的仓库，而里面每个 agent 都报告了成功。这个矛盾，就是这篇要讲的全部。&lt;/p>
